    <ImplementationPlan>
      <T-001><Title>kafedra-design: expose one direct completion action</Title><DependsOn></DependsOn><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Desktop and mobile inspector show Выполнено for non-completed/non-cancelled and Вернуть в работу for completed, without modal or required evidence.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npx playwright test tests/browser/periodic-completion.spec.mjs</Command></Verification></T-001>
      <T-002><Title>kafedra-motion: use no-motion for periodic completion</Title><DependsOn><T-001 /></DependsOn><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>No animation is added; existing focus and prefers-reduced-motion behavior remain valid.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>npx playwright test tests/browser/periodic-completion.spec.mjs</Command></Verification></T-002>
      <T-003><Title>kafedra-feature: add completion transition without widening edit ACL</Title><DependsOn><T-002 /></DependsOn><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Owner/manager/admin transition only status/completed_at and projections; stranger denied; generic PATCH permissions unchanged; optional reports do not drive status.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>node --test tests/periodic-task-completion.test.mjs tests/periodic-task-reports.test.mjs</Command></Verification></T-003>
