      <T-005><Title>kafedra-tests: prove ACL projections history and never-learn</Title><DependsOn><T-004 /></DependsOn><AcceptanceCriteria><Criterion>Tests cover owner/manager/outsider, complete/reopen, calendar and Plan/Fact reads, optional evidence, audit history, and server filtering of the learned status key.</Criterion></AcceptanceCriteria><Verification><Command>node --test tests/periodic-task-completion.test.mjs tests/periodic-task-reports.test.mjs</Command></Verification></T-005>
